( 54 LIFE - seeding: the cell RNG and random cells          )
VARIABLE RND  1 RND !  VARIABLE NG
: SEED ( u -- ) DUP 0= IF DROP 1 THEN RND ! ;
: RNDX ( -- u ) RND @ DUP 7 LSHIFT XOR DUP 9 RSHIFT XOR
  DUP 8 LSHIFT XOR DUP 0= IF DROP 1 THEN DUP RND ! ;
: CELL ( x y -- a m ) 2 LSHIFT SWAP DUP 4 RSHIFT ROT +
  2* CUR @ +  SWAP 15 AND 1 SWAP LSHIFT ;
: LIVE? ( x y -- f ) CELL OVER @ AND SWAP DROP ;
: PLANTAT ( x y -- ) CELL OVER @ OR OVER !
  DUP @ SWAP CUR @ - 2/ DRAWW ;
: SPARK ( n -- ) 4096 MIN 0 NG !
  BEGIN DUP NG @ = 0= WHILE
    BEGIN RNDX 63 AND RNDX 63 AND 2DUP LIVE? WHILE 2DROP REPEAT
    PLANTAT  1 NG +! REPEAT DROP ;
